---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'About · Kenechi Ucheagwu';
const description = 'About Kenechi Ucheagwu: healthcare IT operations, systems automation, computer science, and nursing.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/about/">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="article shell">
    <section class="article-section about-copy">
      <p>I've held three different jobs at the same primary-care clinic: medical assistant, then medical biller, and since 2022, IT Operations & Systems Manager. That order matters. I was a user of clinical systems before I ran them, and I coded claims by hand before I automated the work.</p>
      <p>I finished a B.S. in Computer Science at Saint Peter's University in 2022 while working, and I'm now a BSN nursing student. The combination is deliberate. Healthcare IT is full of software built by people who have never touched a clinical workflow, and clinical staff who can't get their systems changed. I sit in the middle on purpose.</p>
      <p>Training and credentials: HIPAA Security (EPICompliance, 2026), OSHA for Healthcare with Bloodborne Pathogens (EPICompliance, 2026), Cyber Crimes industry credential (iQ4/CWA, 2021). Based in Jersey City, NJ. Open to Healthcare IT, IT operations, sysadmin, and DevOps roles, remote or NYC/NJ.</p>
      <div class="link-row" aria-label="Profile links">
        <a href="mailto:kacy.ucheagwu@gmail.com">Email</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/DaDabbler">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kenechi-ucheagwu">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="/assets/resume.pdf" download>Resume</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
